WEBVTT

00:00:09.329 --> 00:00:13.110
You have no business here, centaur.
This is a Ministry matter.

00:00:16.419 --> 00:00:18.088
Lower your weapons.

00:00:18.255 --> 00:00:19.464
I warn you, under the law,

00:00:19.631 --> 00:00:23.802
as creatures of
near-human intelligence....

00:00:23.969 --> 00:00:25.220
Protego.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:26.638
How dare you?

00:00:27.264 --> 00:00:28.765
Filthy half-breed.

00:00:29.516 --> 00:00:30.558
Incarcerous.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.366
Please. Please stop it. Please.

00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:50.434
Now, enough. I will have order.

00:01:00.046 --> 00:01:02.632
You filthy animal.

00:01:02.799 --> 00:01:05.760
Do you know who I am?

00:01:05.927 --> 00:01:08.353
Leave him alone. It's not his fault.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:10.807
No, he doesn't understand.

00:01:18.481 --> 00:01:21.943
Potter, do something.
Tell them I mean no harm.

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:23.479
I'm sorry, professor.

00:01:24.195 --> 00:01:26.887
- But I must not tell lies.
- What are you doing?

00:01:27.324 --> 00:01:31.202
I am Senior Undersecretary
Dolores Jane Umbridge.

00:01:31.703 --> 00:01:33.830
Let me go!

00:01:36.189 --> 00:01:37.465
Thank you, Grawp.

00:01:38.501 --> 00:01:41.395
Hermione. Hermione, Sirius.

00:01:50.263 --> 00:01:53.310
-How'd you get away?
-Puking Pastilles. It wasn't pretty.

00:01:54.017 --> 00:01:55.914
Told them I was hungry,
wanted some sweets.

00:01:56.311 --> 00:01:58.855
They told me to bugger off
and ate the lot themselves.

00:01:59.731 --> 00:02:01.232
That was clever, Ron.

00:02:02.025 --> 00:02:03.977
-Has been known to happen.
-It was brilliant.

00:02:04.736 --> 00:02:06.529
So how are we getting to London?

00:02:07.864 --> 00:02:11.409
Look, it's not that I don't appreciate
everything you've done, all of you...

00:02:12.243 --> 00:02:14.954
...but I've got you
into enough trouble as it is.

00:02:15.121 --> 00:02:17.353
Dumbledore's Army's supposed to be
about doing something real.

00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:19.503
Or was that all just words to you?

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.532
Maybe you don't have to do this
all by yourself, mate.

00:02:30.553 --> 00:02:31.964
So how are we going to get to London?

00:02:34.099 --> 00:02:35.511
We fly, of course.

00:03:27.402 --> 00:03:29.571
Department of Mysteries.

00:03:38.413 --> 00:03:39.723
This is it.

00:04:33.092 --> 00:04:35.428
Ninety-two. Ninety-three.

00:04:37.138 --> 00:04:38.515
Ninety-four.

00:04:39.766 --> 00:04:40.808
Ninety-five.

00:04:53.404 --> 00:04:56.115
- He should be here.
- Harry.

00:04:58.826 --> 00:05:00.119
It's got your name on it.

